WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,570
In that case, take a good rest

2
00:00:02,570 --> 00:00:05,970
Watch your wife carefully, don't move

3
00:00:05,970 --> 00:00:10,160
Since your aunt is unwell, I won't let you eat here.

4
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:11,360
Run away from her

5
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:14,900
The path in the courtyard is cold and cold, I’ll give you some relief

6
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:17,700
No need to bother uncle, I can go back by myself

7
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:20,630
It doesn’t matter if it takes a little effort

8
00:00:20,630 --> 00:00:22,270
The old lady has rested

9
00:00:22,270 --> 00:00:24,470
I will send the kitchen to your courtyard for Wushan

10
00:00:24,470 --> 00:00:26,110
Stay peacefully in the Hou Mansion

11
00:00:26,110 --> 00:00:28,270
Don't pay attention to the weird gossip.

12
00:00:28,270 --> 00:00:29,950
The embassy came to look for my uncle.

13
00:00:30,390 --> 00:00:31,990
Uncle will support you

14
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:34,470
Uncle Huai Jing is gentle and considerate towards zombies

15
00:00:34,470 --> 00:00:38,030
Anyone who sees him will feel that he is a rare good man in the world.

16
00:00:38,030 --> 00:00:41,630
But why does the zombie have traces of others on his body?

17
00:00:41,630 --> 00:00:44,310
How could someone as good as my uncle carry this on his back?

18
00:00:44,310 --> 00:00:47,830
My uncle seems to have been away from home a few days ago.
